Reason: Audio: the port's Music Volume and SFX Volume settings. TChannel::playLogicalChannel writes a class byte into the voice block it starts (0x006, padding the DSP never reads: 1 when a BGM sequence's track owns the channel, 0 for the SE sequence's tracks and anything else) for the software mixer to scale by the music or SFX gain, and Kernel::mixInterleaveTrack, which mixes THP movie audio into the DAC block on the CPU, scales it by the music gain. Unchanged at 100 percent.
